## Original Content
All package holidays including plane tickets and accommodation have been canceled.

## Summary
A travel company has shut down operations and canceled all of its trips, including package holidays that bundled plane tickets and accommodation. Affected customers are eligible for refunds.

## Key Points
- A travel company has ceased business operations
- All package holidays offered by the company have been canceled
- Canceled bookings include both flight tickets and accommodation
- Refunds are being made available to affected customers


